   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Bright earthy: median ~129 (brightest of the 20), warm yellow-brown shadows (46,47,37), neutral highlights (211,213,201), orange+yellow 52%, muted sky (sat 0.24), saturation 0.26. Best for: Bright daylight landscapes, moorland and heather, autumn woodland, soft overcast scenes, documentary outdoor coverage. Light and natural - good on bright day frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
